<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en"><tei:hi rend="italic">Chazzan and congregation:</tei:hi></tei:note>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yehalelu_et_shem/61"/>His majesty is over the earth and the skies. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/14"/>He will raise the might of His people, [which is] praise for all His pious ones, for the children of Israel, the people near to Him. Praise God.
